    User --> UC1 & UC2 & UC3 & UC5 & UC6 & UC8 & UC10 & UC13 & UC14 & UC15
    UC3 -.->|include| UC4
    UC5 -.->|include| UC9x(["Extract Skills (Model 2)"])
    UC6 -.->|extend| UC7
    UC8 -.->|include| UC9
